WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Troubleshooting is a skill, not a guess. We're going to build your diagnostic
process from the ground up.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Customer communication simulation: practice explaining diagnoses and repair
options to customers in plain language. Technicians must translate technical
findings into terms customers understand. Practice delivering bad news

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here's why this matters on the job: Communication skills directly affect your
income. Technicians who communicate well get better reviews, more referrals, and
higher tips.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Watch out for these: Use plain language not technical jargon. And — Present
options and let the customer decide

00:02:24.000 --> 00:03:00.000
You get a call — condenser fan not spinning, compressor humming. What's the
first thing you check? Answer that before you move on.

